#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:44
#: ffcdcca269364956b4ab262c9f90a95f
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn. * SERIAL0 "
"-> USB * SERIAL1 -> UART1 (GPS) DMA capable * SERIAL2 -> UART2 (MAVLink2) * "
"SERIAL3 -> UART3 (ESC Telemetry) * SERIAL4 -> UART4 (DisplayPort) DMA "
"capable * SERIAL5 -> UART5 (RCin) RX DMA capable * SERIAL6 -> UART6 (User) "
"DMA capable * SERIAL7 -> UART7 (User) DMA Capable * SERIAL8 -> UART8 (User)"
msgstr ""
"上述引脚定义中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 为 UARTn 的发送引脚。* SERIAL0 -> USB "
"* SERIAL1 -> UART1（GPS）支持 DMA * SERIAL2 -> UART2（MAVLink2）* SERIAL3 -> "
"UART3（ESC 数传）* SERIAL4 -> UART4（DisplayPort）支持 DMA * SERIAL5 -> UART5（RC "
"输入）RX 支持 DMA * SERIAL6 -> UART6（用户）支持 DMA * SERIAL7 -> UART7（用户）支持 DMA * "
"SERIAL8 -> UART8（用户）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:57
