#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:65
#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:66
#: 2c4c3f2c24004cc6836ef4941186f7c7 85d664e5891448ebb4f484dd3db25527
#: 92b73c3f4a444560ba5042524b970bcf b3459f1363404df28cdb0c4114e8b26b
#: bd92e1bb3a424f65b6b61cbfe98a72c1 cedcf4127dfd4886af29b51d21f36ae9
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:66
#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:67
#: 0c223806bb324b4eb419842023375174 6b2c7d7464b74075bcc98e3eded83760
#: 813d847372f14cebb14bc007567c60b0 d07c665560034c72bdedca8fba46a381
#: f528896477a24155867facfc8cac9cb6 f61495c62ce444af9e6ccba1cd9dbd1f
msgid ""
"The DAKEFPV H743/Pro supports up to 14 outputs. The pads for motor output M1"
" to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus "
"S1-4, LED on  separate pads for LED strip and other PWM outputs. M1-8, S1, "
"and S2 support B-Directional DShot. OSD, S3-4 support only PWM. The LED "
"output supports serial LED or DShot."
msgstr ""
"DAKEFPV H743/Pro 最多支持 14 路输出。M1 至 M8 的电机输出焊盘同时在电机连接器和独立焊盘上提供，另外还有 S1-4、LED "
"等独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带和其他 PWM 输出。M1-8、S1 和 S2 支持双向 DShot。OSD、S3-4 仅支持 PWM。LED 输出支持串行"
" LED 或 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:70
#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:71
#: 1f8c1d1d9363432687376fe8a4b3d582 3dd6f1ff2d7349dba3d0c2d339faaede
