#: d625312bf6334d3ea44ea2225c2712cc ec8f19401dc04abc94759bae9b411b66
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up"
" to 12S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "板载内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入，电流传感器最大可读取 130A，电压传感器最高支持 12S 锂电池。"

