#: d52b1543713346b3aa7d60665fe8ab58 e78a0dcc1d134447ac48a6082637fab7
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the camera output to the connectors marked \"CAM1\" and "
"\"CAM2\". Setting this GPIO low switches the video output from CAM1 to CAM2."
" By default RELAY1 is configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制标记为「CAM1」和「CAM2」连接器的摄像头输出。将此 GPIO 设为低电平可将视频输出从 CAM1 切换至 "
"CAM2。默认情况下，RELAY1 配置为控制此引脚并将 GPIO 设为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:116
#: ../../source/docs/common-dakefpvh743pro.rst:117
#: 5225243ee3cc44b0a7d49e7d0eb9cd42 8163b8e0563f476a972b4e9a21cf752e
