#: 9442280d4a8a40ab8648623a2ba445ac fde95e4696364dfcb5b3f6ebf805887d
msgid ""
"The HD VTX connector can have RX4 replaced by the analog VTX signal if that "
"connector is used for analog VTX connection by using the DJI/VTX jumper "
"pads."
msgstr "如通过 DJI/VTX 跳线焊盘将该连接器用于模拟 VTX 连接，HD VTX 连接器上的 RX4 可替换为模拟 VTX 信号。"

